WEBVTT

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:12.880
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.260
<i>Birdramon.</i>

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.430
<i>This Digimon evolves from Piyomon.</i>

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:17.490
LEVEL: CHAMPION

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:20.160
TYPE: GIANT BIRD

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.100
<i>Meteor Wing is a powerful special move.</i>

00:00:20.160 --> 00:00:23.100
SPECIAL MOVE: METEOR WING

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:23.100
<i>The attack shoots burning feathers
at the enemy!</i>

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.190
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:29.070
<i>The color of Birdramon's fire shows
that it's around 1,500 degrees.</i>

00:00:29.230 --> 00:00:32.030
<i>Sora-san's always riding Birdramon
without any problems.</i>

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:34.860
<i>Maybe she sits on a special cushion?</i>

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:39.950
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.090
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:48.090
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:54.170
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:54.170
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:10.940
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:10.940
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:15.950
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:01:11.110 --> 00:01:15.950
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.160
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:01:16.110 --> 00:01:21.160
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:26.330
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:26.330
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.750
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.750
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:37.550
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:37.550
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.430
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:37.720 --> 00:01:42.430
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.640
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:47.640
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:52.520
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:47.810 --> 00:01:52.520
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:58.320
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:52.690 --> 00:01:58.320
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:04.160
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:04.160
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:09.460
<i>At the end of a long journey,</i>

00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:14.420
<i>the three children, Taichi, Koshiro,
and Mimi, returned to Tokyo.</i>

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:26.520
<i>However, it turned out to be a fake Tokyo
created within the Digital World.</i>

00:02:31.860 --> 00:02:34.570
We're still in the Digital World.

00:02:34.940 --> 00:02:38.240
This is a city made from data,
an artificial Tokyo!

00:02:43.330 --> 00:02:44.990
<i>Taichi's team struggled to fight.</i>

00:02:45.160 --> 00:02:51.000
<i>But the other team,
Yamato, Sora, and Joe, came just in time</i>

00:02:51.170 --> 00:02:53.340
<i>and they defeated Eyesmon together.</i>

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:11.980
<i>However, before they could
even catch their breath,</i>

00:03:12.150 --> 00:03:15.190
<i>a new Digimon appeared
from where Eyesmon had fallen.</i>

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:32.540
THE BATTLE IN TOKYO AGAINST OROCHIMON

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.000
Don't tell me...

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:41.220
Eyesmon evolved?!

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:42.680
Look!

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:49.470
W-What?! There's more of them?!

00:03:53.560 --> 00:03:56.690
W-Whoa, how many are there?!

00:03:57.270 --> 00:03:58.150
No.

00:03:58.780 --> 00:03:59.900
That's...

00:04:05.160 --> 00:04:07.330
Orochimon, an Ultimate Digimon.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:11.910
Those eight heads are all one Digimon!

00:04:13.790 --> 00:04:15.830
OROCHIMON

00:04:18.500 --> 00:04:19.590
What is it?!

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:25.390
Is this...

00:04:26.720 --> 00:04:27.970
an EMP?!

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:30.780
EM... what?!

00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:32.620
A strong electromagnetic pulse!

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:33.440
Huh?

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:36.940
It's probably that Orochimon's roar!

00:04:49.580 --> 00:04:52.140
It's affecting the real Shibuya too?!

00:04:52.140 --> 00:04:53.250
What?!

00:04:58.290 --> 00:05:00.590
Giga Storm!

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.740
Hammer Spark!

00:05:23.530 --> 00:05:24.500
Agumon!

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.740
Gomamon!

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:33.390
Everyone, let's retreat once!

00:05:41.170 --> 00:05:42.250
Hurry and get on!

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:43.800
Okay!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.600
Hurry, Taichi, Yamato!

00:05:53.010 --> 00:05:55.020
Yamato, we need to hurry!

00:05:57.440 --> 00:05:58.480
Yamato!

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:05.150
Garudamon, us too!

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:12.160
Go back, Weregarurumon!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:14.660
We need to finish this now!

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:16.200
But...

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:24.270
Oh, no!

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:26.010
Everyone, grab on!

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.570
We're falling!

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:33.390
But my entrance exam score can't fall!

00:06:47.860 --> 00:06:49.450
What a mess.

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.340
What's wrong?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:54.580
My GPS has been acting weird.

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:05.840
Is everyone all right?

00:07:06.460 --> 00:07:07.630
Somehow...

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:10.090
I thought we were done for.

00:07:11.800 --> 00:07:16.160
An Ultimate Digimon like us, but with
a huge body and incredible power...

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:18.600
That Digimon's ridiculous!

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:23.860
How is it fair
to have eight heads anyway?!

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:27.480
Gomamon...

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.090
I'm fine.

00:07:30.090 --> 00:07:33.110
But that was a little tough.

00:07:33.740 --> 00:07:38.870
Just when we thought we defeated Eyesmon,
something even more powerful appeared!

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:43.120
For now, if we just hide here...

00:07:45.270 --> 00:07:47.900
Joe! Shh! Shh!

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:52.010
O-Orochimon's looking for us.

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:53.820
No way!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:55.260
I'm scared!

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:58.180
Effects on the real Shibuya...

00:07:58.560 --> 00:08:01.620
The different speeds
of time synchronizing...

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.020
Koshiro-san?

00:08:03.560 --> 00:08:09.030
Eyesmon was drawing massive data
from our world over to this side.

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:14.200
<i>That created the chaos known
as Tokyo's major power failure on one end,</i>

00:08:14.610 --> 00:08:17.660
<i>and on the other, this fake Tokyo.</i>

00:08:18.120 --> 00:08:19.970
<i>Despite being in the Digital World,</i>

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:23.830
<i>Eyesmon created a special dimension
that linked with our world.</i>

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:27.920
<i>And that evolution into Orochimon.</i>

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:33.510
All of these facts have meaning
and they all connect.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:38.870
If I theorize it that way,
I might be able to see something.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:41.660
You don't ever forget
your intellectual pursuits.

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:43.310
That's my Koshiro-san!

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:47.270
I wonder if Taichi's side is okay...

00:08:55.610 --> 00:08:56.950
It's no use.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:01.080
Maybe this is because
of that EMP Koshiro mentioned.

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:30.980
What happened earlier?

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:35.860
If Orochimon's power
is directly affecting our world too,

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:38.700
we can't be taking our time.

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:42.870
I need to take that thing down at once.

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:47.370
In Daikanyama, right near Shibuya.

00:09:48.170 --> 00:09:49.130
That's where

00:09:49.790 --> 00:09:51.130
<i>my brother...</i>

00:09:51.840 --> 00:09:53.460
<i>Takeru lives there.</i>

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:54.800
<i>What?!</i>

00:09:55.300 --> 00:09:58.130
YAMATO

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:22.830
Yamato...

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:31.380
This is right in the middle
of Shibuya, huh...

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:38.800
What is it?

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:51.940
The trains started running!

00:10:52.400 --> 00:10:53.290
Is that true?!

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:54.690
It's on the news!

00:10:55.230 --> 00:10:57.210
Let's go! They could stop again soon.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:00.030
Yeah, staying here won't help.

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.850
Hikari, let's get out.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:06.720
Huh?

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:08.790
Looks like the trains are faster.

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:17.210
They said the Inokashira Line's moving!

00:11:17.550 --> 00:11:19.510
The subway seems okay too!

00:11:23.550 --> 00:11:24.410
Hikari!

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:25.720
-Don't push!
-Move over!

00:11:26.640 --> 00:11:29.730
Yeah, it's not only our world.

00:11:30.350 --> 00:11:33.410
There were lots of Digimon
here in this world

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:36.730
who were suffering because of bad Digimon.

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:41.990
A lot happened with me here too.

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:45.010
Cheer up, Mimi.

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:46.550
I'm fine.

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:47.740
Thank you.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:51.890
Uh-huh. I'm proud of you, Mimi-kun!

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:53.750
I went through a lot too!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:55.520
However!

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:58.860
I, who overcame those obstacles

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:03.910
have become a much bigger person now!

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.390
I think.

00:12:06.510 --> 00:12:12.190
Gomamon literally became bigger
and evolved into a strong Zudomon too.

00:12:13.600 --> 00:12:15.920
Oh, if you're talking about size...

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:18.400
Garudamon would rival you.

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:22.210
Then I'm the most beautiful!

00:12:22.210 --> 00:12:23.840
Only when you're Lilimon.

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:25.550
Jeez, Mimi!

00:12:25.550 --> 00:12:27.280
Err, um...

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.550
What about me?

00:12:29.550 --> 00:12:34.080
If it's the coolest,
that's got to be Atlurkabuterimon!

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:36.330
Koshiro-san...

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:37.460
Yup.

00:12:37.960 --> 00:12:41.340
Even though we split into two teams,
we still made it here.

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:45.640
If we all work together,
we'll get through this.

00:12:47.640 --> 00:12:49.560
I wasn't prepared at first, but...

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:52.990
I'll try my best too!

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:54.060
Me too!

00:12:54.390 --> 00:12:57.060
That's true. Let's do this!

00:13:03.780 --> 00:13:06.490
Yes, surely we'll get through this.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.830
No, we are getting through this!

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:21.460
We're still being hunted.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:26.720
Gabumon, you good to go?

00:13:27.260 --> 00:13:28.070
Yeah!

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.180
Wait!

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:31.120
It's useless stopping us.

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.450
I won't stop you.

00:13:32.450 --> 00:13:34.980
But if you're gonna do it,
we'll both do it.

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:38.500
Oh, not both.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:40.980
Agumon and Gabumon are with us too.

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.920
Yeah, let's do it!

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:43.740
Yeah!

00:13:44.490 --> 00:13:46.300
You're too curious.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.340
You know it's gonna be dangerous.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:52.450
If it's danger, I've been through it
dozens of times during this trip.

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.000
So have I.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:25.610
Let's keep moving underground
until we get in front of Orochimon's face.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:29.570
Even with eight heads,
there's only one body.

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:32.280
There's just one target to aim for!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:33.950
We're close!

00:14:34.910 --> 00:14:36.160
You ready?!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:37.470
Yeah!

00:14:37.470 --> 00:14:38.790
Let's go, Agumon!

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.210
Okay!

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:45.130
Agumon Evolution!

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.130
Greymon!

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:53.870
Greymon!

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:56.140
Mega Flame!

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:04.920
Garurumon!

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:07.110
Fox Fire!

00:15:10.400 --> 00:15:11.110
Yamato!

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:17.160
Garurumon!

00:15:29.610 --> 00:15:33.820
Garurumon Super Evolution!

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.950
Weregarurumon!

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:00.100
Now, here I come!

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:06.020
Kaiser Nail!

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:14.890
All right!

00:16:15.260 --> 00:16:16.220
Greymon!

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:33.010
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:16:47.730 --> 00:16:50.250
Metalgreymon!

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:06.190
It's probably Taichi-san and them.

00:17:10.150 --> 00:17:11.150
That's the one!

00:17:11.570 --> 00:17:12.970
Metalgreymon!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:13.840
Yeah!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:15.970
Giga Storm!

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:33.820
Metalgreymon!

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:35.220
Don't worry!

00:17:35.970 --> 00:17:37.090
Weregarurumon!

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:40.200
I can still fight!

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:42.180
Yeah, we can fight too!

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:49.810
Look, look! Over here!

00:17:50.360 --> 00:17:52.080
I'll take that head!

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:55.590
I'll take the other two over there!

00:17:56.070 --> 00:17:59.220
If we put all our powers together...

00:17:59.220 --> 00:18:02.770
We'll divide up the rest of the heads
and take care of them!

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:03.970
You guys...

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.410
Finish this once and for all!

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:20.320
Now, everyone!

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:21.260
Okay!

00:18:26.810 --> 00:18:28.320
Metalgreymon!

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:29.190
Yeah!

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:42.930
Flower Cannon!

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:09.060
Just a little more.

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:19.240
Yamato...

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:33.170
Giga Storm!

00:19:55.730 --> 00:20:00.130
Giga Destroyer!

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:12.580
Look!

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:16.840
That black one
was Orochimon's real head.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:18.090
The rest were decoys.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:21.800
They were limbs made to look like heads!

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:42.070
I'm pooped...

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.820
Everyone worked real hard.

00:20:45.570 --> 00:20:47.550
Mimi...

00:20:47.550 --> 00:20:48.950
Yes, yes.

00:20:49.910 --> 00:20:51.950
I'm hungry now...

00:20:53.250 --> 00:20:55.060
I'm glad everyone was safe.

00:20:55.060 --> 00:20:57.080
Thanks to you, Gomamon.

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:01.150
Phew! This time was really dangerous!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.970
Uh-huh.

00:21:03.300 --> 00:21:05.340
That's why I told you earlier.

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:08.930
But we got through it.

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.230
So did everyone, right?

00:21:21.320 --> 00:21:23.690
Now, our world will surely...

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:27.320
Huh?

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:32.870
What is it?!

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.510
A countdown?

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:46.430
What in the world?

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:15.580
<i>naze ima kono te to te nigitte</i>

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:15.580
<i>Why do these held hands</i>

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:18.250
<i>tashikameta taion wo</i>

00:22:15.750 --> 00:22:18.250
<i>And the warmth exchanged</i>

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:20.710
<i>natsukashiku omou noka</i>

00:22:18.420 --> 00:22:20.710
<i>Make me reminisce now</i>

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:26.300
<i>naze samidare no susabu shinen</i>

00:22:22.460 --> 00:22:26.300
<i>Why an abyss dancing with endless rain</i>

00:22:26.470 --> 00:22:28.800
<i>hohoenda sono shisen ni</i>

00:22:26.470 --> 00:22:28.800
<i>The gaze of that smile</i>

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:30.180
<i>nakitaku naru</i>

00:22:28.970 --> 00:22:30.180
<i>Makes me want to cry</i>

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:33.100
<i>sono koe de boku wo yonde kure</i>

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:33.100
<i>So call me with that voice</i>

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:35.270
<i>dare ni ienu kono yowasa ga</i>

00:22:33.260 --> 00:22:35.270
<i>This weakness I cannot tell others</i>

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>I realize is my pillar to stand firm</i>

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:38.350
<i>tsuyoku tatsu tame no jiku dato omoishiru</i>

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:40.650
<i>Difference is what makes me adore you</i>

00:22:38.520 --> 00:22:40.650
<i>chigau kara itooshiku naru</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:43.610
<i>I just want to understand you and me</i>

00:22:40.810 --> 00:22:43.610
<i>tada wakaritai kimi to boku wo</i>

00:22:43.770 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>Scars grow the more we live</i>

00:22:43.770 --> 00:22:45.820
<i>ikiru hodo kizu ga fuete iku</i>

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:49.070
<i>But still we seek the reasons for us</i>

00:22:45.990 --> 00:22:49.070
<i>sore demo sagashiteiru bokura no wake wo</i>

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:51.320
<i>Overlaying them makes us beautiful</i>

00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:51.320
<i>kasanete wa utsukushiku naru</i>

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:55.240
<i>I want to know now, I want to cry out</i>

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:55.240
<i>ima wakaritai sakebi dashitai</i>

00:23:01.750 --> 00:23:03.630
<i>The Chosen Ones are cornered.</i>

00:23:03.790 --> 00:23:07.760
<i>The destinies of their younger siblings
in Tokyo begin to unravel.</i>

00:23:07.920 --> 00:23:12.010
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Countdown to Tokyo's Annihilation"</i>

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:14.810
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
